        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 7.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio, nalola lundi, mala nabona lifuumbi liwaanga, nende sisiekhala khu lifuumbi chana siabonekhana nga omundu, ne ekuutwa eye sahabu yaba khu murwe kwewe, ne engeso enjoki mukhono mwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe. 3.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio, malaika okundi echa khukhwama mu Lukaangu ne aboolela mu mumilo kwe angaaki oyo owaba ne ekhaale khu lifuumbi, ali, “Rumikhira engeso yowo mala okese, sikila esaa eye likesa yolile, sibala sialabile siolile likesa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio, oyo owaba ne ekhaale khu lifuumbi auucha engeso yewe khu sibala, mala sibala siakesibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.16",
