              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio, abwenao malaika okundi, owimeelela kumulilo, aama khu alutare aochelela ne kumumilo kwe angaaki malaika owaba ne engeso enjoki ali, “Rumikhira engeso yowo, mala okhale kamatuunda ke kumusabibu khukhwama mu mukuunda kwe sibala, sikila chisabibu charobire!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
