              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio malaika oyo auucha engeso yewe khu sibala, akhala kamatuunda ke kumusabibu khukhwama khu sakia aakamwaata mu sisuuriro sie endali eye burafu bwe lirima lia Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
